{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7fbdb4ab-07fb-4b66-a955-28abdc375d65",
    "name": "Moderation Layer",
    "description": "Rule-based moderation layer that inspects/sanitizes/gates text and file payloads before they reach a downstream LLM. See Architecture.md in the repo root for the full design.\n\nStart the server with `npm start` (and `npm run worker` if you want to exercise the async-queue requests). Default base URL is http://localhost:3000.\n\nFolders are ordered to match how a request actually flows through the system: Health -> File Validator -> the four content Detectors (each callable standalone) -> Token Validator -> Orchestrator (the real end-to-end entrypoint) -> Admin (rule packs) -> Jobs (async queue polling).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "18928924",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/18928924-7fbdb4ab-07fb-4b66-a955-28abdc375d65?source=collection_link"
  },
